1
00:00:00,830 --> 00:00:04,330
(Leonard:)Boy, you sure get your money's
worth out of these games.

2
00:00:06,370 --> 00:00:10,000
(Leonard:)Priya, can I come in?
Sure.

3
00:00:11,510 --> 00:00:12,840
(Leonard:)Oh, God.

4
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:15,010
(Sheldon:)What?
It's okay.

5
00:00:15,010 --> 00:00:17,980
(Leonard:)You didn't know.
I'll take care of it.

6
00:00:17,980 --> 00:00:20,030
What-what did I do?

7
00:00:20,030 --> 00:00:21,480
(Leonard:)Sheldon doesn't allow flossing

8
00:00:21,480 --> 00:00:23,050
(Leonard:)that close to the mirror.

9
00:00:23,050 --> 00:00:24,150
(Priya:)You're kidding.

10
00:00:24,150 --> 00:00:25,750
(Leonard:)It's a splatter thing.

11
00:00:25,760 --> 00:00:27,590
(Leonard:)There's a little piece of tape
on the floor

12
00:00:27,590 --> 00:00:29,520
(Leonard:)you're supposed to stand behind.

13
00:00:29,530 --> 00:00:31,460
(Priya:)That's madness.
I know.

14
00:00:31,460 --> 00:00:33,690
(Leonard:)Just do it. There's a big
inspection coming up,

15
00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:36,710
(Leonard:)and I don't want to lose
my TV privileges.

16
00:00:36,720 --> 00:00:38,830
(Priya:)You really need
to let me take a look

17
00:00:38,840 --> 00:00:40,570
(Priya:)at that roommate agreement,
one of these days.

18
00:00:40,570 --> 00:00:42,090
(Leonard:)Mm, I don't know.

19
00:00:42,090 --> 00:00:44,260
(Leonard:)I get a lawyer,
he gets a lawyer...

20
00:00:44,260 --> 00:00:46,870
(Leonard:)It's just easier
to stand behind the tape.

21
00:00:46,880 --> 00:00:48,610
(Priya:)Oh, by the way,
a fellow at work

22
00:00:48,610 --> 00:00:50,390
(Priya:)said I could use his
Dodger tickets this weekend.

